#==[32000]-通货 Currency - 可堆叠通货 Enshrouding Crystals==


#==[32001]- Enshrouding Crystals -笼罩水晶 可堆叠通货 - 基础 - 精确==
Show
    BaseType == "Imperial Enshrouding Crystal" "Karui Enshrouding Crystal" "Maraketh Enshrouding Crystal" "Templar Enshrouding Crystal" "Vaal Enshrouding Crystal"
    SetFontSize 39
    SetTextColor 218 187 85 255
    SetBorderColor 212 175 55 255
    SetBackgroundColor 16 16 22 255
    PlayAlertSound 2 300
    MinimapIcon 1 Orange Circle

#==[41000]-Curse of the Allflame Curse of the Allflame - 笼罩物品 Enshrouded Gear==


#==[41001]- 笼罩物品 -笼罩装备 笼罩物品 - 基础 - 精确==
